        "text": [
          "I spent most of my childhood on the internet, reading design and architecture and fashion and technology blogs—"
        ],
        "url": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pXDxKjNYbgAnrfoFlSl0F",
      "order": 2,
      "layout": "Title",
      "content": {
        "images": [],
        "text": [
          "—and collecting a lot of images. I used [Pinterest](https://www.pinterest.com/celinenguyen/) for many years. now I use [Are.na](https://www.are.na/celine-nguyen/channels)"
        ],
        "url": ""
      }
    },
